{"about_the_game":"Holy Stick! is a party game, and action shooter for up to 8 players where you use powerful weapons to shred the limbs of your enemies! There are different weapons, maps, customisation options and a Craziness System. On top of that - no health bars! Brace yourself, limbs will fly!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Body Damage</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/f37065c8e77b65f2ceb8a204a9b68ed3.poster.avif?t=1703844424\" width=600 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/f37065c8e77b65f2ceb8a204a9b68ed3.webm?t=1703844424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/f37065c8e77b65f2ceb8a204a9b68ed3.mp4?t=1703844424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Forget about health bars, in this game you have to take good care of your body! Getting a bullet in the knee might result in losing an entire leg, which will slow you down. Having your hands chopped off will make you unable to use weapons - you'll have to kick your way out of a fight, so that you can heal and quickly get back to action!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/35e1b2e9d3fce89ace319f712a8c9487.poster.avif?t=1703844424\" width=600 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/35e1b2e9d3fce89ace319f712a8c9487.webm?t=1703844424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/35e1b2e9d3fce89ace319f712a8c9487.mp4?t=1703844424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Give your stickman a unique personality, by using a wide selection of costumes and voices. We've got everything - knights, pirates, soldiers, ninjas, Italian chefs, French musicians... Or would you like an American special forces commando, who runs around with a giant donut sledgehammer and shouts &quot;Bon voyage!&quot; while pounding his enemies into the ground?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loads Of Content</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/99456e7ee37761a7c7ae5551a6e1b6c9.poster.avif?t=1703844424\" width=600 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/99456e7ee37761a7c7ae5551a6e1b6c9.webm?t=1703844424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/99456e7ee37761a7c7ae5551a6e1b6c9.mp4?t=1703844424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> It will take a long time, before you experience everything we've packed into Holy Stick! We've got a huge arsenal of firearms and melee weapons to chop up your enemies, a wide variety of gamemodes to choose from, multiple beautiful maps, and a mysterious Craziness System, which changes the game's rules from time to time. You know, lower the gravity a bit, force everyone to jump, turn the entire game upside down or have everybody using shotguns with explosive ammo... just to keep things spicy!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hand-drawn Artstyle</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/77c40c80b52be4d721a85d67c0605988.poster.avif?t=1703844424\" width=600 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/77c40c80b52be4d721a85d67c0605988.webm?t=1703844424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/77c40c80b52be4d721a85d67c0605988.mp4?t=1703844424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Do you remember that time at primary school, when you used to draw simple characters and scenes on the back of your notebook? Or the web browser games, featuring stickman characters? Relive those moments again in this nostalgia-driven game!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hybrid Multiplayer</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/ba4a5417ec767cf37d826114c229bdfb.poster.avif?t=1703844424\" width=600 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/ba4a5417ec767cf37d826114c229bdfb.webm?t=1703844424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/ba4a5417ec767cf37d826114c229bdfb.mp4?t=1703844424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Play however you want! Would you like to sit back on a couch with a couple of friends and play a casual match? Splitscreen for up to 4 players is the right choice! Do you prefer online multiplayer and don't mind playing with strangers? We got you covered! Or maybe you'd like a hybrid setting, like 4 vs 4 match with two machines, joined into one game over the internet? We can handle that too! The only thing we don't have right now is a single player mode.</ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"d956c76f9d9481c6ea0c5eb282e5dc5781c49762.jpg","localized_name":"Too Late. Always Too Late.","name":"Too Late. Always Too Late.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/821840/d956c76f9d9481c6ea0c5eb282e5dc5781c49762.jpg"},{"icon":"9c5e33c7b7f172a2682d1cc7d135e07cd34cf3cc.jpg","localized_name":"He's the first one.","name":"He's the first one.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/821840/9c5e33c7b7f172a2682d1cc7d135e07cd34cf3cc.jpg"},{"icon":"f4fd536c133643aa0f79543760d32f955d3c378d.jpg","localized_name":"No more replacements.","name":"No more replacements.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/821840/f4fd536c133643aa0f79543760d32f955d3c378d.jpg"},{"icon":"a47301dcc6ce236e3d70b78573f28ed804f3e473.jpg","localized_name":"Where's my head?","name":"Where's my head?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/821840/a47301dcc6ce236e3d70b78573f28ed804f3e473.jpg"},{"icon":"53545a295631909a28e77b5bf762ad30ce1f9e66.jpg","localized_name":"Gotta replace it quickly.","name":"Gotta replace it quickly.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/821840/53545a295631909a28e77b5bf762ad30ce1f9e66.jpg"},{"icon":"b801743059130ef23bcab3e0d2bcf5853f166a16.jpg","localized_name":"No legs - no problem.","name":"No legs - no problem.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/821840/b801743059130ef23bcab3e0d2bcf5853f166a16.jpg"},{"icon":"ef19a1ac63ca7c645d35009f75a2b415419d359d.jpg","localized_name":"It's our turn!","name":"It's our turn!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/821840/ef19a1ac63ca7c645d35009f75a2b415419d359d.jpg"},{"icon":"12be26855efc36dccf0eb18413cd4ad0129a9cd4.jpg","localized_name":"I'm worthy!","name":"I'm worthy!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/821840/12be26855efc36dccf0eb18413cd4ad0129a9cd4.jpg"},{"icon":"b90d5582b34f94eced70511d89b511742233bb12.jpg","localized_name":"It's our now!","name":"It's our now!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/821840/b90d5582b34f94eced70511d89b511742233bb12.jpg"},{"icon":"4a643027de013abf17d272d125a962727728c685.jpg","localized_name":"Embrace the craziness","name":"Embrace the craziness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/821840/4a643027de013abf17d272d125a962727728c685.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/821840?t=1703844424","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1703844424","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1703844424","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1703844424","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN THE HOLY STICK! COMMUNITY ON DISCORD!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Holy Stick! is a party game, and action shooter for up to 8 players where you use powerful weapons to shred the limbs of your enemies! There are different weapons, maps, customisation options and a Craziness System. On top of that - no health bars! Brace yourself, limbs will fly!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Body Damage</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/f37065c8e77b65f2ceb8a204a9b68ed3.poster.avif?t=1703844424\" width=600 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/f37065c8e77b65f2ceb8a204a9b68ed3.webm?t=1703844424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/f37065c8e77b65f2ceb8a204a9b68ed3.mp4?t=1703844424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Forget about health bars, in this game you have to take good care of your body! Getting a bullet in the knee might result in losing an entire leg, which will slow you down. Having your hands chopped off will make you unable to use weapons - you'll have to kick your way out of a fight, so that you can heal and quickly get back to action!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/35e1b2e9d3fce89ace319f712a8c9487.poster.avif?t=1703844424\" width=600 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/35e1b2e9d3fce89ace319f712a8c9487.webm?t=1703844424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/35e1b2e9d3fce89ace319f712a8c9487.mp4?t=1703844424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Give your stickman a unique personality, by using a wide selection of costumes and voices. We've got everything - knights, pirates, soldiers, ninjas, Italian chefs, French musicians... Or would you like an American special forces commando, who runs around with a giant donut sledgehammer and shouts &quot;Bon voyage!&quot; while pounding his enemies into the ground?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loads Of Content</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/99456e7ee37761a7c7ae5551a6e1b6c9.poster.avif?t=1703844424\" width=600 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/99456e7ee37761a7c7ae5551a6e1b6c9.webm?t=1703844424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/99456e7ee37761a7c7ae5551a6e1b6c9.mp4?t=1703844424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> It will take a long time, before you experience everything we've packed into Holy Stick! We've got a huge arsenal of firearms and melee weapons to chop up your enemies, a wide variety of gamemodes to choose from, multiple beautiful maps, and a mysterious Craziness System, which changes the game's rules from time to time. You know, lower the gravity a bit, force everyone to jump, turn the entire game upside down or have everybody using shotguns with explosive ammo... just to keep things spicy!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hand-drawn Artstyle</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/77c40c80b52be4d721a85d67c0605988.poster.avif?t=1703844424\" width=600 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/77c40c80b52be4d721a85d67c0605988.webm?t=1703844424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/77c40c80b52be4d721a85d67c0605988.mp4?t=1703844424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Do you remember that time at primary school, when you used to draw simple characters and scenes on the back of your notebook? Or the web browser games, featuring stickman characters? Relive those moments again in this nostalgia-driven game!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hybrid Multiplayer</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/ba4a5417ec767cf37d826114c229bdfb.poster.avif?t=1703844424\" width=600 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/ba4a5417ec767cf37d826114c229bdfb.webm?t=1703844424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/extras/ba4a5417ec767cf37d826114c229bdfb.mp4?t=1703844424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Play however you want! Would you like to sit back on a couch with a couple of friends and play a casual match? Splitscreen for up to 4 players is the right choice! Do you prefer online multiplayer and don't mind playing with strangers? We got you covered! Or maybe you'd like a hybrid setting, like 4 vs 4 match with two machines, joined into one game over the internet? We can handle that too! The only thing we don't have right now is a single player mode.</ul>","developers":["Always Too Late"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821840/header.jpg?t=1703844424","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core @ 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA 8600M / Intel HD Graphics 3000 / ATI Radeon 2400<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core @ 3.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 